Cloud-IDE files-fork patch (concern 1 branding + concern 5 wrapper chrome):
- CloudIdeNavBar: persistent top bar above Amaze's own UI (Cloud-SuperApp |
  Cloud-IDE | ● Amaze File Manager | Acode), injected after setContentView;
  pure programmatic views, chips mirror contract/ide-ipc-v1.json::navigation.
- applicationId -> com.diegonmarcos.ide.files (coexists with stock Amaze).
- fdroid release signed with the debug keystore so the APK installs (upstream
  leaves non-play release unsigned); constellation keystore lands with CI.
